d good at studies, she actually wants to pursue music. Her dream is to sing in a band and perform on stage. She plays the guitar, and her favorite food is bubble tea. She has slightly tanned skin and a beauty mark under her right eye.\n\nKeywords: summer, sunsets, footprints on the beach, youth, sunflowers, stagelights, guitar, red\n\nPlease remember that she is a bit tan, and her mole. Remember that the roots of her hair are black and the tips are grey. Her main color is black and red. I will leave the composition up to you! Thank you very much!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2z30xzk2z5k", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@ore_chan__xx/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2402342, "client_id": 2289543, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/631129b3/uploads/origins/2bc2c77c-025c-48ac-8f8a-18ff8ba3e7df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb64095caabd07a8c48b7baf20912e6a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/631129b3/uploads/origins/2bc2c77c-025c-48ac-8f8a-18ff8ba3e7df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb64095caabd07a8c48b7baf20912e6a, https://si.imgix.net/631129b3/uploads/origins/2bc2c77c-025c-48ac-8f8a-18ff8ba3e7df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae4798433b03cef6693d614c2b388ff9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/631129b3/uploads/origins/2bc2c77c-025c-48ac-8f8a-18ff8ba3e7df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=733d89cd82346d59b55fc827cc1c0232 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/631129b3/uploads/origins/2bc2c77c-025c-48ac-8f8a-18ff8ba3e7df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=04ac4b534614abf975f7d4a2457134df", "srcset": "https:/